ex:SelectedComponent ex:process_state_kind_corresponds_to_membership_state ex:SelectedMembership .
ex:CalculationDayComponent ex:process_state_kind_corresponds_to_membership_state ex:CalculationMembership .
ex:ImplementedComponent ex:process_state_kind_corresponds_to_membership_state ex:ImplementedMembership .
